Worktree: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/182-dispatch-lint-held-fixes (your current directory).
Spec folder: specs/cli-external-orchestration/082-opencode-v1-v2-dual-compat/040-dispatch-lint-held-fixes (pre-approved, skip Gate 3)

ROLE: Act as a code agent. Make exactly one change, plus its test.

Problem: in `.skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.mjs`, `matchDispatchShape` (the audit's classifier, used by `recordDispatch`) accepts only what `inspectDispatch` calls `direct`. The preflight decides with `resolveDispatchPacket`, which also unwraps exec wrappers (`nohup`, `command`, `env`, `timeout`, `perl -e ... --`, a subshell) and shell `-c` payloads. So `nohup opencode run -m p/m "hi" </dev/null` is linted before it runs but never recorded after.

Fix: make `matchDispatchShape(command)` return `{ skill }` of the first entry `resolveDispatchPackets(command)` returns, or `null` when it returns none. Keep its JSDoc and update it to say it resolves the way the preflight does. Change nothing else.

Test, in `.skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.test.mjs`, inside `describe('matchDispatchShape', ...)`, add one `it` that asserts:
- `matchDispatchShape('nohup opencode run -m p/m "hi" </dev/null')` equals `{ skill: 'cli-opencode' }`;
- `matchDispatchShape("perl -e 'alarm 300; exec @ARGV' -- codex exec task </dev/null")` equals `{ skill: 'cli-codex' }`;
- `matchDispatchShape("cat > run.sh <<'EOF'\nopencode run -m p/m x\nEOF")` is `null`;
- `matchDispatchShape('command -v opencode')` is `null`.
Every existing `matchDispatchShape` and `recordDispatch` test must keep passing unchanged.

Comments keep the durable WHY and never name spec paths, phases, or task, review or finding ids.

VERIFICATION (run each from the worktree root with node from /Users/michelkerkmeester/.nvm/versions/node/v26.8.2/bin on PATH; all must pass):
node --check .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.mjs
.skilled/node_modules/.bin/vitest run .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.test.mjs --exclude "**/review/containment/**"
node --test .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.test.mjs

